{"skill":{"slug":"google-search","displayName":"google-search"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1787305042381,"changelog":"Initial release of the google-search skill:\n\n- Provides programmatic access to Google search results as clean JSON with support for search operators (site:, filetype:, intitle:, exact phrases).\n- No need for Google Custom Search Engine, per-day quotas, or billing accounts.\n- Simple HTTP GET requests with pay-per-call (USDC/x402) or prepaid credits (Bearer key).\n- Supports pagination, UI language (hl), and country/region scoping.\n- Includes error codes and multiple usage scenarios for convenience.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":4438,"sha256":"3f2eca7aa8a9e18d7ed96f951458b8d83db0dae5f71ec42848c0417d5415e538","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2274,"sha256":"38faf066ee9cdebba6ecb5a939ed3e24d1f6a0de17629eea2885b4baa39e1208","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789557318234,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"d1d62702b7e3a633652bece9c7c1339b7b75f3c8e24250a0a107a17bfdeb728c","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/d1d62702b7e3a633652bece9c7c1339b7b75f3c8e24250a0a107a17bfdeb728c","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1787305308991},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789557318234},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward guide for using a paid third-party Google search API, with its credential and payment behavior disclosed.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network calls to fetcher.sh and disclosure of search queries to that service are expected for the purpose; users should treat query text as shared with a third-party provider.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill includes an MCP server configuration for google.fetcher.sh and Bearer-key examples, but does not ship executable install scripts or bundled code.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Instructions are scoped to search queries, pagination, localization, API errors, and MCP configuration; no prompt overrides, hidden agent instructions, or unrelated capabilities were found.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, local file access, or background execution is present; the only standing authority shown is an optional API key in MCP headers.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is programmatic Google/SERP search, and the artifact only documents HTTP and MCP access to that search service.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that searches are sent to fetcher.sh and may incur charges through prepaid credits or x402 pay-per-call. Use a limited-scope key or payment budget, and avoid sending sensitive query text unless you are comfortable sharing it with the provider.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789557318234}}}}}